Package: rogdelta
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ROG Delta II Linux Project <rogdelta@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, easyeffects (>= 8), pipewire-bin, wireplumber, vivaldi-stable | chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable
Recommends: pipewire-pulse
Homepage: https://github.com/mbekkelund/rog-delta-ii
Description: Linux control center for the ASUS ROG Delta II headset
 Native Go desktop application and command-line utility for the ASUS ROG
 Delta II 2.4 GHz headset. It provides device detection, PipeWire volume and
 mute controls, sidetone, custom equalization, EasyEffects sound presets, and
 passive HID protocol capture.
